 "metered": "The register lists it as gas. We show it as waste heat: it runs on waste gas and heat from NZ Steel's ironmaking, not pipeline gas.\nIts metered output (meter points GLN0111 and GLN0332) runs about 1.47 times the dispatch data's figure, so expect a step where the metered history meets the dispatch weeks.",
